[statement]
Of the providers an entry admitting earlier versions admits, one at a
version outranks one at no version, whatever their priorities: for `v<3`,
apk installs `b`, which provides `v` at 2, over `a`, which provides it at
no version with a priority of 10.

[repository]
P:a
V:1
k:10
p:v

P:b
V:2
k:1
p:v=2

[request]
v<3

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install b 2
